"text": "And when teams adopt Shimano equipment within that system, the benefits become apparent \u2013 I've seen this pattern repeat itself in three different teams.",
"char_start": 5283,
"char_end": 5435,
"unit_id": "t0035.u01",
"sent_id": "t0035.s01"
},
{
"start": 1399.5,
"end": 1402.38,
"speaker_label": "Luc\u00eda Herrera",
"text": "What is the heuristic that you always rely on?",
"char_start": 5451,
"char_end": 5497,
"unit_id": "t0036.u01",
"sent_id": "t0036.s01"
},
{
"start": 1402.44,
"end": 1406.22,
"speaker_label": "Luc\u00eda Herrera",
"text": "Where do maintenance and transmission mechanics intersect?",
"char_start": 5498,
"char_end": 5556,
"unit_id": "t0036.u01",
"sent_id": "t0036.s02"
},
{
"start": 1406.22,
"end": 1412.04,
"speaker_label": "Diego Ferrer",
"text": "Frankly, the service intervals for the suspension are a risk management decision.",
"char_start": 5571,
"char_end": 5652,
"unit_id": "t0037.u01",
"sent_id": "t0037.s01"
},
{
"start": 1412.1,
"end": 1416.36,
"speaker_label": "Diego Ferrer",
"text": "And the second-order effect is the part that almost everyone overlooks.",
"char_start": 5653,
"char_end": 5724,
"unit_id": "t0037.u01",
"sent_id": "t0037.s02"
},
{
"start": 1680.0,
